* DOI: 10.3390/app14062390
* Open Access: Yes
* Full Text: https://doi.org/10.3390/app14062390
*
* KEY OPTIMIZED PARAMETERS FROM THE PUBLICATION:
* - ETL (TiO2) thickness: 100 nm
* - Perovskite absorber (MAPbI3) thickness: 1300 nm (1.3 µm)
* - HTL (Cu2O) thickness: 400 nm
* - Defect density in MAPbI3: 10^14 cm^-3
* - Interface defect density: 10^13 cm^-2
* - Maximum simulated PCE: 19.30%
* - Voc: ~1.15 V
* - Jsc: ~22.5 mA/cm^2
* - FF: ~78%
*
* Device Architecture: Au / Cu2O / MAPbI3 / TiO2 / ITO
*
* This file is directly usable in SCAPS 1D version 3.3.09
